<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_7c8882bd-db2e-4ea6-8b6a-36224d7a2565"
id="sec.4-he"><b>24-Hour Economy Commissioner</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A 24-Hour Economy Commissioner (the <defterm
type="definition" guid="_28bddbb4-1a76-4570-af6d-23d5e95dc7ed"
id="def.Commissioner-oc.2"><b><i>Commissioner</i></b></defterm>) must be
employed under the <legref refid="act-2013-040" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act
2013</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>
</level>


