<head>
<no><b>Division 2</b></no><heading
guid="_a87acd12-e81b-418f-92f1-99f2d0d9f7c3" id="pt.2-div.2-he"><b>Functions
of Commissioner</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2cafb380-4d18-4c89-96bb-aad2b5a3079e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_9ed53a0e-3aca-4355-9b4f-77e3797c4505"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Functions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_540532d3-eb9c-433f-b466-056b59a50f59"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Commissioner has the following
functions&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c7609c7e-879a-426d-ae38-58e32837ceab" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to advocate for, and promote the interests of,
the night-time economy State-wide,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7c4d0654-5605-4548-ae2b-44ccaa21f147" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to advocate for policy change, legislative
reforms and other improvements about the night-time economy, including by
attending relevant forums and conferences and being involved in negotiations
between stakeholders,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f7372f7a-94ee-44d3-a376-fc3b55966f1c" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to drive collaboration between government
agencies to address common issues, and promote better policy development,
about the night-time economy,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f8b0175e-f459-4504-8de7-f0a604d59d13" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to provide advice, recommendations and reports to
the Minister, at the request of the Minister or on the Commissioner&#8217;s
own initiative, about matters relating to the night-time
economy,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f87a33df-fb25-4e2d-ad7d-0dd8ae574132" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to raise awareness and provide education about,
and conduct programs and other activities to promote&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_aca9b51a-085a-4da3-99ae-0da3b4ff4fdb"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.e-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">understanding of issues affecting the night-time
economy, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5b3a34a4-1bb9-4868-9665-0eb610e7f87c"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.e-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">compliance with legislation affecting the
night-time economy, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_58ca1fe3-8409-4bf3-98e9-a636a969511b"
id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.e-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">best practice in relation to other matters
affecting the night-time economy,</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d8d27f0c-2f26-4ebb-b45e-1591c36b2704" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to promote and enhance multiculturalism as part
of the night-time economy,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_569a3fd2-432a-4fd6-a884-a48f38d9ffe9" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to advocate for a mix of diverse cultural, social
and business activities and experiences as part of the night-time
economy,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_996ba4ac-a64a-4c14-91b8-4b319259b8ea" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to encourage more collaboration across industry,
local government and the NSW Government in delivery initiatives in relation to
the night-time economy,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dc9b5a06-8278-453e-9635-7a6e5723135c" id="sec.5-ssec.1-para1.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">other functions conferred on the Commissioner by
this Act or another Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_80ed51fd-b211-48e0-9b39-4456739605b6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Commissioner is not subject to the control
and direction of the Minister or any other person in relation to the contents
of advice, a report or recommendations given to the
Minister.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c02b65d3-547f-475b-96b4-0fb58e8ac306"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_753c9bbf-b056-4cd9-93db-7a43748b374f"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Advisory Council</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4b73d6be-3a46-45b4-80d6-1f8925431659"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may establish a 24-Hour Economy
Advisory Council to provide advice to the Commissioner in relation to the
exercise of the Commissioner&#8217;s functions.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_992b83af-25ef-42bc-b64d-fdc243ba6451"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The members of the Advisory Council are to be
appointed by the Minister on the recommendation of the
Commissioner.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fbb60cf8-337e-4107-ba08-c8d7a2dd49b8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The members of the Advisory Council must include
at least one person who, in the Minister&#8217;s opinion, represents the
interests of regional New South Wales, whether because the
person&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_93558f8d-bcce-4bce-baf1-de822c0955f3" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">resides or works in, or advocates for, regional
New South Wales, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_569e2cb6-f495-46d2-b2b7-28603331e744" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">represents an organisation that works in,
represents or advocates for regional New South
Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6ae4dcdc-8755-4842-9b1a-7d047db878c2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the Minister establishes the Advisory Council,
the Minister may issue a charter to the Advisory Council that
outlines&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_210858fb-839d-4042-a6e7-7e01d47c9495" id="sec.6-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Advisory Council&#8217;s terms of reference
and the way in which it is to operate, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_82900bea-e601-42f6-9b16-f57289ae1756" id="sec.6-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any requirements for the Advisory Council to
report to the Minister or the Commissioner.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_26bf11a5-03d3-4533-8a0f-e738312135de"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may abolish the Advisory Council at
any time.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_795e75aa-ad83-40e9-a9bb-e2324c7bab5b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_b21b715b-7ef1-4832-8862-4d1a9a692528"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Reports</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4887ba9d-1811-4378-9fd0-6be91bfb4f78"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Commissioner may, in exercising the
Commissioner&#8217;s functions&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_af90ca7a-6817-4642-8727-da7064b76604" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">prepare a report about a particular issue or a
general matter relating to the Commissioner&#8217;s functions, including a
report containing forecasts about matters relating to the night-time economy,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9fad772a-5e99-47ee-a38e-2dadad42cfe9" id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">give the report to the
Minister.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6b46ad7d-f4c2-437f-befb-4a6c1bc2d61f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may provide a report given to the
Minister under subsection (1)(b) to the Presiding Officer of each House of
Parliament.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8f156bbb-2499-4c2c-b94a-6d76c421c465"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report provided to the Presiding Officer of a
House of Parliament under subsection (2) must be laid before that House within
5 sitting days of that House after it is received by the Presiding
Officer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="division" id="pt.2-div.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a1abdd73-8d2b-4657-a174-f703e8290285"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2-div.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Division 3</b></no><heading
guid="_c9023485-488d-4843-af76-1a06d139e579" id="pt.2-div.3-he"><b>Powers of
Commissioner</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c559e6e9-75b3-4db8-9a4c-41a5da71b42f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_8be71b77-5b24-43b6-a378-e28e492c41f3"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Cooperation between Commissioner and other agencies and
organisations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_39478e27-367d-4101-b3c7-1392397e5b28"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Commissioner and other government agencies
that provide or deal with services or issues affecting the night-time economy
in the State must work in cooperation in the exercise of their
functions.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_005ee6a3-afa0-48d0-aeb1-74153c2fccd6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Arrangements may be made by the Minister with the
Minister to whom a government agency is responsible for cooperation under
subsection (1), including the provision by the agency of information or access
to documents required by the Commissioner in relation to the
Commissioner&#8217;s functions.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_696f227c-f379-41e4-9a88-329c24c6b1fc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_a37bdc46-44cb-488b-b583-22dc367b2ac0"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Power to conduct inquiries</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b32e8896-a8fd-4617-959e-58ab13f2b8e6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may direct the Commissioner to
conduct an inquiry into an issue affecting the night-time economy at any
time.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e1635620-3726-4c3b-bd3c-f98c8622c532"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A direction under subsection (1) may
be&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2f65eede-af80-4e53-ae92-d96a2e683a6a" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at the request of the Commissioner,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ced02861-067c-453c-abb2-55c028105973" id="sec.9-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on the Minister&#8217;s own
initiative.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_64c052b5-3d06-4ebe-9c1e-e068d9ebda4f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), the Minister may
direct the Commissioner to conduct an inquiry into the establishment,
operation, suspension or revocation of a special entertainment precinct within
the meaning of the <legref refid="act-1993-030" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Local Government Act
1993</i></name></legref>, section 202.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_236699d0-7b4e-4067-a2a9-02d1c97a8b76"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of an inquiry under this
section, the Minister may request the attendance or advice of representatives
of government agencies, including representatives of agencies that deal with
matters relating to the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e110fef5-916b-45b9-a5b2-300abd41b9c0" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">public health,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9e85d8c7-ddea-4fd6-9b7c-dd1e6de8ed8f" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">liquor and gaming,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f134c411-54fe-4a02-99c0-aee8acf2d43f" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">arts and culture,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a267bc71-3328-4cf0-824a-d537b65f5576" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">planning,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_59382916-f457-462f-a627-e81ce95c665a" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">multiculturalism,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_07a31ffe-90b7-4361-9145-e79f6bc2881d" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">policing,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9982b1b5-8d54-4549-b77c-8399aac7e3e6" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">transport,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3ca69ec1-5856-4980-a548-fe8bcef2a59e" id="sec.9-ssec.4-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">local government.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_83a8fbb1-101b-4640-9667-79a61eb55108"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">As soon as practicable after conducting an
inquiry under this section, the Commissioner must&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dfc85d71-a56d-4b82-bb63-56b9c875ba9d" id="sec.9-ssec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">prepare a report about the inquiry,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a1d5e90c-e0d1-446c-95a4-955c49fecfe6" id="sec.9-ssec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">give a copy of the report to the
Minister.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_630e5b4f-74e5-476f-b28b-07ca8c032a0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The report must include&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3d55f08a-97f5-4913-ac7a-d53cbcce3433" id="sec.9-ssec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">recommendations about the matter the subject of
the inquiry, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_414d2f98-a0f2-4ebc-837c-7f64f57be1a5" id="sec.9-ssec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the inquiry related to a matter referred to in
subsection (3)&#8212;recommendations about the establishment or future
operation of the special entertainment precinct and the reasons for the
recommendations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0c37108-8bf2-45f1-bdc2-8b24b27025fd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may provide the report to the
Presiding Officer of each House of Parliament.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a931ab38-1a0a-4703-8b39-ad8a417ef7d9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(8)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report provided to the Presiding Officer of a
House of Parliament under subsection (7) must be laid before that House within
5 sitting days of that House after it is received by the Presiding
Officer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</level>
